<%# System status (design spec §6.1, Task 9): the setup wizard's own
    `Setup::SystemCheck` results, through the wizard's own results partial
    so both screens word every check identically. "Run again" reloads this
    screen, which re-runs every check. %>
<% content_for :title, "System status" %>
<div class="mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3">
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-h1 text-ink">System status</h1>
    <p class="mt-1 text-meta">The same checks the setup wizard runs. A warning explains what won't work and how to fix it.</p>
  </div>
  <%= link_to "Run again", admin_system_status_path(**admin_url_options), class: setup_secondary_link_class %>
</div>

<%= render "setup/system_check_results", results: @results %>
